<HelloFraandsPage title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ki kamaai aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<p>Standard conversation hosts use the Standard call tariff and do not set a price. Influencers and celebrities set their fan price after full video KYC and administrator approval.</p>
<h2>Standard host earnings</h2><p>You earn ₹2.00 for every connected minute, paid by the second. A 30-second conversation earns ₹1.00. Ringing, missed calls and calls that do not connect earn ₹0.</p>
<h2>Example: a 15-minute call</h2><ul><li>Connected time: 15 minutes.</li><li>You earn: 15 × ₹2.00 = ₹30.00.</li></ul>
<h2>Influencer and celebrity earnings</h2><p>You choose a whole-rupee fan price from ₹5 to ₹1,000 per minute. Your earnings are 60% of the connected-call charge, minus ₹2.00 for each connected minute to cover the telephone call. The platform keeps 40%; GST on that platform share is absorbed by the platform and is not added to the fan's price or deducted again from you.</p>
<p>Example at ₹20 per minute for a one-minute connected call: the fan pays ₹20, your earning is ₹10, ₹2 covers the call, and the platform share is ₹8.</p>
<h2>Payouts</h2><p>Your earnings and their payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. New earnings are held for 7 days. The minimum payout is ₹500. Each payout is approved by our team and sent to a bank account or UPI ID in your own name.</p>
<h2>Taxes need final review</h2><p>PAN, TDS, GST treatment and the host earnings statement must be confirmed and disclosed before payouts launch. Tax obligations depend on each host's circumstances; seek independent tax advice if needed.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
